  "Spark Paw Fox": "Renard patte d'étincelle",
  "Spark Paw Fox carries replacement stars through every route. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper, and Elephant Crownkeeper each test one five-route region before reopening it. Clearing Route 30 reconnects all six regions.": "Spark Paw Fox transporte des étoiles de remplacement sur chaque itinéraire. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper et Elephant Crownkeeper testent chacun une région à cinq itinéraires avant de la rouvrir. La suppression de la route 30 reconnecte les six régions.",
